d, clothes, shoes, accessories, books, toys, household items, and more, the RFK Farmers & Flea Market has you covered!\n\n For inquiries please contact Tracy Fleming at 443-670-6225.","source_url":"https://eventsdc.com/events/rfk-farmers-and-flea-market-44"},"status":"published"},{"title":"District of Columbia \"Household Hazardous Waste Collection and Drop Off\"","description":"Get ready to declutter + dispose of hard-to-recycle items at the DPW Special Waste Collection Event - only 1 ticket per family needed.\n\n - FOR DC RESIDENTS ONLY -\n\n----------------------------\n\nDC DPW’s Special Waste Collection Event, scheduled for Saturday, September 12, 2026, will be held atRFK Stadium''s Parking Lot 8.\n\nTo help attendees navigate to Lot 8, accessible off of Independence Ave SE, the GPS coordinates to the entrance are 38.888049, -76.971237.\n\nYou may alsoclick this link to open Google Maps on your smartphone to guide you to the event''s location.\n\n----------------------------\n\nJoin the DC Department of Public Works (DPW) Special Waste Collection Events to:\n\n Safely dispose of your household hazardous waste,\n\nRecycle your old electronics, and\n\nSecurely shred your sensitive personal documents.\n\n DPW now requires registration to participate in the Special Waste Collection Eventsto ensure everyone is accommodated safely and in a timely manner.","category":"community","tag":"Collection","tags":["Collection","City services"],"venue_name":"RFK Stadium","venue_address":"2400 East Capitol St SE, Washington, DC 20003","venue_type":"Stadium","neighborhood":"Capitol Hill","venue_url":"https://eventsdc.com/node/","venue_image_url":"","date":"2026-09-12","time":"8:00 AM","starts_at":"2026-09-12T08:00:00-04:00","ends_at":"2026-09-12T14:00:00-04:00","timezone":"America/New_York","price":"","price_min":"","price_max":"","is_free":false,"source":"eventsdc","external_id":"146072","ticket_url":"","external_url":"https://eventsdc.com/events/district-columbia-household-haza