etball Association (WNBA) expansion franchises to be established and the longest tenured continuously operating women’s professional sports team in Washington, D.C. We look forward to seeing you at the CareFirst Arena, home of the Washington Mystics.","source_url":"https://eventsdc.com/events/washington-mystics-vs-connecticut-sun-0"},"status":"published"},{"title":"District of Columbia \"Household Hazardous Waste Collection and Drop Off\"","description":"Get ready to declutter + dispose of hard-to-recycle items at the DPW Special Waste Collection Event - only 1 ticket per family needed.\n\n - FOR DC RESIDENTS ONLY -\n\n----------------------------\n\nDC DPW’s Special Waste Collection Event, scheduled for Thursday, September 24, 2026, will be held atRFK Stadium''s Parking Lot 8.\n\nTo help attendees navigate to Lot 8, accessible off of Independence Ave SE, the GPS coordinates to the entrance are 38.888049, -76.971237.\n\nYou may alsoclick this link to open Google Maps on your smartphone to guide you to the event''s location.\n\n----------------------------\n\nJoin the DC Department of Public Works (DPW) Special Waste Collection Events to:\n\n Safely dispose of your household hazardous waste,\n\nRecycle your old electronics, and\n\nSecurely shred your sensitive personal documents.\n\n DPW now requires registration to participate in the Special Waste Collection Eventsto ensure everyone is accommodated safely and in a timely manner.","category":"community","tag":"Collection","tags":["Collection","City services"],"venue_name":"RFK Stadium","venue_address":"2400 East Capitol St SE, Washington, DC 20003","venue_type":"Stadium","neighborhood":"Capitol Hill","venue_url":"https://eventsdc.com/node/","venue_image_url":"","date":"2026-09-24","time":"10:00 AM","starts_at":"2026-09-24T10:00:00-04:00","ends_at":"2026-09-24T14:00:00-04:00","timezone":"America/New_York","price":"","price_min":"","price_max":"","is_free":false,"source":"eventsdc","external_id":"146071","ticket_url":"