mediate relief while organizing toward long-term self-determination and community control of health.\n\n The PPWF will provide:\n\n Free high blood pressure screenings\n\nFree glucose tests (diabetes screening) (available upon request)\n\nFree hygiene products and medical supplies\n\nFree health information and guidance for preventative care","category":"community","tag":"Wellness","tags":["Wellness","Workshop","Culture"],"venue_name":"R.I.S.E. Demonstration Center","venue_address":"2730 Martin Luther King Jr Ave SE, Washington, DC 20032","venue_type":"Community Venue","neighborhood":"Congress Heights","venue_url":"https://eventsdc.com/node/20","venue_image_url":"","date":"2026-09-27","time":"12:00 PM","starts_at":"2026-09-27T12:00:00-04:00","ends_at":"2026-09-27T15:00:00-04:00","timezone":"America/New_York","price":"","price_min":"","price_max":"","is_free":false,"source":"eventsdc","external_id":"147779","ticket_url":"","external_url":"https://eventsdc.com/events/peoples-pan-african-wellness-front-series-2","image_url":"https://eventsdc.com/sites/default/files/styles/upcoming_event/public/event-images/35440/main-image-9d15c42409addb9cc1375753c47d720c.png.webp?itok=5-m665hd","raw_json":{"api_row":{"title":"People''s Pan-African Wellness Front Series","field_end_date":"2026-09-27T15:00:00","field_image":"/sites/default/files/styles/upcoming_event_782_x_440_/public/event-images/35440/main-image-9d15c42409addb9cc1375753c47d720c.png.webp?itok=b6Eavo7C","field_start_date":"2026-09-27T12:00:00","field_venue":["20"],"nid":"147779","field_event_type":"5"},"event_type_name":"Conventions & Meetings","full_description":"The People’s Pan-African Wellness Front (PPWF) is a community-based grassroots program led by PACA to confront the health disparities impacting African/Black working-class communities in Southeast Washington, D.C. Inspired by revolutionary legacies like the Black Panther Party’s People’s Free Medical Clinics and the Cuban healthcare model, this program seeks to deliver immediate relief while organizing toward long-term self-determination and community control of health.\n\n The PPWF will provide:\n\n Free high blood pressure screenings\n\nFree glucose tests (diabetes screening) (available upon request)\n\nFree hygiene products and medical supplies\n\nFree health information and guidance for preventative care","source_url":"https://eventsdc.com/events/peoples-pan-african-wellness-front-series-2"},"status":"published"}]'::jsonb) item
  where nullif(item->>'venue_name', '') is not null
    and nullif(item->>'venue_address', '') is not null
  group by item->>'venue_name', item->>'venue_address'
) venue_item
on conflict (name, address) do update
set source_name = coalesce(public.venues.source_name, excluded.source_name),
    source_key = coalesce(public.venues.source_key, excluded.source_key),
    venue_type = excluded.venue_type,
    neighborhood = excluded.neighborhood,
    website_url = coalesce(nullif(public.venues.website_url, ''), excluded.website_url),
    image_url = coalesce(nullif(public.venues.image_url, ''), excluded.image_url),
    raw_data = public.venues.raw_data || excluded.raw_data,
    updated_at = now();

insert into public.events (
  title, description, category, tag, tags, venue_name, venue, neighborhood, venue_address,
  date, time, starts_at, ends_at, timezone, price, price_min, price_max, is_free,
  source, external_id, ticket_url, external_url, url, image_url, raw_json, status,
  last_seen_at, created_at, updated_at
)
select
  item->>'title',
  item->>'description',
  item->>'category',
  item->>'tag',
  array(select jsonb_array_elements_text(item->'tags')),
  item->>'venue_name',
  item->>'venue_name',
  item->>'neighborhood',
  item->>'venue_address',
  nullif(item->>'date', '')::date,
  nullif(item->>'time', ''),
  nullif(item->>'starts_at', '')::timestamptz,
  nullif(item->>'ends_at', '')::timestamptz,
  item->>'timezone',
  nullif(item->>'price', ''),
  nullif(item->>'price_min', '')::numeric,
  nullif(item->>'price_max', '')::numeric,
  coalesce((item->>'is_free')::boolean, false),
  item->>'source',
  item->>'external_id',
  nullif(item->>'ticket_url', ''),
  item->>'external_url',
  item->>'external_url',
  nullif(item->>'image_url', ''),
  item->'raw_json',
  item->>'status',
  now(), now(), now()
from jsonb_array_elements('[{"title":"Digital Government Institute''s \"930gov Conference and Expo\" 2026","description":"At a time when technological change is accelerating faster than ever, especially with the rapid rise of artificial intelligence, government IT professionals need a trusted environment to separate hype from reality, understand what is practical today, and prepare for what comes next. 930gov is designed to provide that environment through education, peer collaboration, and direct engagement with both government and industry experts.\n\n As an independent organization, DGI''s commitment has always been to the government community we have supported for more than 25 years. The 14th Annual 930gov brings that commitment to life through five focused conference tracks covering Artificial Intelligence, AI/Cyber, Data Management, Enterprise Architecture/Mission Enablement, and Records Management.","category":"expos","tag":"Conference","tags":["Conference","Expo","Convention","Convention center"],"venue_name":"Walter E. Washington Convention Center","venue_address":"801 Allen Y. Lew Place NW, Washington, DC 20001","venue_type":"Convention Center","neighborhood":"Mount Vernon Square","venue_url":"https://eventsdc.com/node/2","venue_image_url":"","date":"2026-07-28","time":"7:00 AM","starts_at":"2026-07-28T07:00:00-04:00","ends_at":"2026-07-28T23:59:00-04:00","timezone":"America/New_York","price":"","price_min":"","price_max":"","is_free":false,"source":"eventsdc","external_id":"134714","ticket_url":"https://digitalgovernment.com/930gov-2026-registration/#register?utm_source=dccc&utm_medium=website&utm_campaign=930gov-register","external_url":"https://eventsdc.com/events/digital-government-institutes-930gov-conference-and-expo-2026","image_url":"https://eventsdc.com/sites/default/files/styles/upcoming_event/public/event-images/32307/main-image-8d5906e42f9fe42548865d8f329f86f0.png.webp?itok=aK73zd1h","raw_json":{"api_row":{"title":"Digital Government Institute'