ociation (WNBA) expansion franchises to be established and the longest tenured continuously operating women’s professional sports team in Washington, D.C. We look forward to seeing you at the CareFirst Arena, home of the Washington Mystics.","source_url":"https://eventsdc.com/events/washington-mystics-vs-atlanta-dream-0"},"status":"published"},{"title":"Flourish & Grow: A Back-to-School Mental Wellness Workshop","description":"On August 8, 2026, Positively Caviar, Inc. will host its 5th annual immersive back-to-school mental wellness workshop, “Flourish & Grow,” at the R.I.S.E. Demonstration Center in Washington, D.C., from 10:00 AM to 2:00 PM. \n\n Designed for middle school-aged youth, this transformative experience equips participants with practical, experiential tools rooted in positive psychology to strengthen emotional resilience, boost well-being, and disrupt mental health stigmas in their schools and communities. The workshop will feature interactive activities, mindfulness exercises, and engaging discussions, all within a fun, supportive environment. Lunch, snacks, and free school supplies will be provided.\n\n For more information and to register, visit: positivelycaviar.com/flourish-grow.","category":"community","tag":"Wellness","tags":["Wellness","Workshop"],"venue_name":"R.I.S.E. Demonstration Center","venue_address":"2730 Martin Luther King Jr Ave SE, Washington, DC 20032","venue_type":"Community Venue","neighborhood":"Congress Heights","venue_url":"https://eventsdc.com/node/20","venue_image_url":"","date":"2026-08-08","time":"10:00 AM","starts_at":"2026-08-08T10:00:00-04:00","ends_at":"2026-08-08T14:00:00-04:00","timezone":"America/New_York","price":"","price_min":"","price_max":"","is_free":false,"source":"eventsdc","external_id":"145357","ticket_url":"https://eventsdc.com/positivelycaviar.com/flourish-grow","external_url":"https://eventsdc.com/events/flourish-and-grow-back-school-mental-wellness-workshop-0","image_url":"https://eventsdc.com/sites/de